  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_amomum_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>an odoriferous plant, now appropriated to a genus of aromatic plants (family Zingiberaceæ) including the species which yield Cardamoms and Grains of Paradise (OED s.v. amomum)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
